# Lieutenant Nyota Uhura: "Strange new worlds — {4}, {T}: Target opponent exiles the top X cards of their library, where X is the
# number of differently named lands you control. You may cast an instant or sorcery spell from among them without paying its
# mana cost. Then that player puts the rest on the bottom of their library in a random order."
